      <title>通用URLDownloadToFileA&amp;ShellExecute ShellCode</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/15/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8URLDownloadToFileA&amp;ShellExecute%20ShellCode/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/15/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8URLDownloadToFileA&amp;ShellExecute%20ShellCode/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>x86架构中：</p><ol><li>栈是从<code>高地址</code>向<code>低地址</code>生长的，也就是<code>向下生长</code>。</li><li>字符串的读取顺序：从<code>低地址</code>向<code>高地址</code>直到遇到<code>\0</code>。</li><li>采用<code>小端序</code>：<strong>数据的低位字节存放在内存的低地址，高位字节存放在高地址</strong>。</li></ol><p>masm编译asm，打印汇编对应机器码命令</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ml.exe /c /coff test.asm</span><br><span class="line">#test.obj是上一个命令执行之后的产物</span><br><span class="line">link.exe /dump /disasm test.obj</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><iframe src="/images/PEFormat.pdf" width="100%" height="100%" style="border: 0;"></iframe><p><img src="/images/867232_UQX698BZWQ7UZ8Y.jpg"><br>x86中获取kernel32基址：</p><p><img src="/images/kernel32%E5%9F%BA%E5%9D%80%E7%9A%84%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95.png"><br>PE文件格式：<br><img src="/images/pe.png">通过dll基址动态寻找函数地址<br><img src="/images/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%9F%BA%E5%9D%80%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E5%AF%BB%E6%89%BE%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80.png"><br>DOS MZ Header的结构体定义如下：_IMAGE_DOS_HEADER</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">//0x40 bytes (sizeof)</span><br><span class="line">struct _IMAGE_DOS_HEADER</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_magic;                  //0x0        可执行文件标记“MZ”</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_cblp;                   //0x2        文件最后页的字节数</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_cp;                     //0x4        文件页数</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_crlc;                   //0x6        重定义元素个数</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_cparhdr;                //0x8        头部尺寸，以段落为单位</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_minalloc;               //0xa        所需的最小附加段</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_maxalloc;               //0xc        所需的最大附加段</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_ss;                     //0xe        初始化堆栈段</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_sp;                     //0x10       初始化堆栈指针</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_csum;                   //0x12       校验和</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_ip;                     //0x14       入口IP值</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_cs;                     //0x16       入口CS值</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_lfarlc;                 //0x18       重分配表文件地址</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_ovno;                   //0x1a       覆盖号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_res[4];                 //0x1c       保留字</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_oemid;                  //0x24       OEM标识符</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_oeminfo;                //0x26       OEM信息</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT e_res2[10];               //0x28       保留字</span><br><span class="line">    LONG e_lfanew;                   //0x3c       PE文件头的相对偏移地址</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>PE文件头在winnt.h中由IMAGE_NT_HEADERS32结构体定义</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">//0xf8 bytes (sizeof)</span><br><span class="line">struct _IMAGE_NT_HEADERS</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG Signature;                               //0x0        PE文件标识</span><br><span class="line">    struct _IMAGE_FILE_HEADER FileHeader;          //0x4        映像文件头</span><br><span class="line">    struct _IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER OptionalHeader;  //0x18       可选映像头</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>Signature</code>默认是<code>0x00004550</code>，ASCII码是<code>PE00</code></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">//0x14 bytes (sizeof)</span><br><span class="line">struct _IMAGE_FILE_HEADER</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT Machine;                      //0x0      运行平台</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT NumberOfSections;             //0x2      文件的区块数</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG TimeDateStamp;                 //0x4      文件创建日期和时间</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG PointerToSymbolTable;          //0x8      符号表指针</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG NumberOfSymbols;               //0xc      符号表中的符号个数</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT SizeOfOptionalHeader;         //0x10     IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32结构大小</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT Characteristics;              //0x12     文件属性</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>Machine</code>：可执行文件的目标CPU类型。</p><table><thead><tr><th>机器类型</th><th>预定义标志</th><th>十六进制值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Intel i386</td><td>IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_I386</td><td>14CH</td></tr><tr><td>Intel 64</td><td>IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_IA64</td><td>200H</td></tr><tr><td>IBM Power PC</td><td>IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_POWERPC</td><td>1F0H</td></tr><tr><td>Dec Alpha AXP</td><td>IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_ALPHA</td><td>184H</td></tr><tr><td>Dec Alpha AXP64</td><td>IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_ALPHA64</td><td>284H</td></tr><tr><td><code>NumberOfSections</code>:文件中的区段数目，<code>区段表</code>紧跟在PE文件头后面。</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>SizeOfOptionalHeader</code>:紧跟在本结构体之后的<code>IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32</code>结构体的大小，即<code>sizeof(IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32)</code>,应该是<code>00E0h</code></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>Characteristics</code>:文件属性标志字段，对于<code>普通的可执行</code>文件此字段值应为<code>010Fh</code>,对于<code>dll文件</code>，此字段值应为<code>210Eh</code>。</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="IMAGE-OPTIONAL-HEADER32结构体"><a href="#IMAGE-OPTIONAL-HEADER32结构体" class="headerlink" title="IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32结构体"></a>IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32结构体</h3><p>可选映像头</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">//0xe0 bytes (sizeof)</span><br><span class="line">struct _IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT Magic;                                       //0x0       标志符</span><br><span class="line">    UCHAR MajorLinkerVersion;                           //0x2       链接器主版本号</span><br><span class="line">    UCHAR MinorLinkerVersion;                           //0x3       连接器次版本号</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfCode;                                   //0x4       所有含代码区块的总大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfInitializedData;                        //0x8       所有初始化数据区块的总大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfUninitializedData;                      //0xc       所有未初始化数据区块的总大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG AddressOfEntryPoint;                          //0x10      程序执行入口RVA</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG BaseOfCode;                                   //0x14      代码区块起始RVA</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG BaseOfData;                                   //0x18      数据区块起始RVA</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG ImageBase;                                    //0x1c      映像基址</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SectionAlignment;                             //0x20      内存中区块对齐值</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG FileAlignment;                                //0x24      文件中区块对齐值</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MajorOperatingSystemVersion;                 //0x28      操作系统主版本号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MinorOperatingSystemVersion;                 //0x2a      操作系统次版本号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MajorImageVersion;                           //0x2c      用户自定义主版本号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MinorImageVersion;                           //0x2e      用户自定义次版本号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MajorSubsystemVersion;                       //0x30      所需要子系统主版本号</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT MinorSubsystemVersion;                       //0x32      所需要子系统次版本号</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG Win32VersionValue;                            //0x34      保留，设为0</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfImage;                                  //0x38      内存中的映像总大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfHeaders;                                //0x3c      区块表及其之前结构的总大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG CheckSum;                                     //0x40      校验和</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT Subsystem;                                   //0x44      文件子系统</span><br><span class="line">    USHORT DllCharacteristics;                          //0x46      DLL特性标志</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfStackReserve;                           //0x48      初始化堆栈大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfStackCommit;                            //0x4c      初始化实际提交堆栈大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfHeapReserve;                            //0x50      初始化保留堆大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG SizeOfHeapCommit;                             //0x54      实际提交堆大小</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG LoaderFlags;                                  //0x58      调试相关，默认为0</span><br><span class="line">    ULONG NumberOfRvaAndSizes;                          //0x5c      数据目录表的项数</span><br><span class="line">    struct _IMAGE_DATA_DIRECTORY DataDirectory[16];     //0x60      数据目录表结构</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="相对虚拟地址（RVA）"><a href="#相对虚拟地址（RVA）" class="headerlink" title="相对虚拟地址（RVA）"></a>相对虚拟地址（RVA）</h4><p>PE文件中的某个数据在装入内存后，相对于内存中文件头的偏移量。<br><code>Magic</code>:一个标记字，<code>ROM映像</code>，则值为<code>0107h</code>;<code>普通可执行文件映像</code>值为<code>010Bh</code>。<br><code>SizeOfCode</code>:带有IMAGE_SCN_CNT_CODE属性的区块的总大小，并且是经过字节对齐后的值。新增代码区块，这个值需要进行相应的更改。</p><p>需要用到的API：</p><table><thead><tr><th>API</th><th>动态链接库</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></content>
      
      
